    slug: "severance-pay-rules",
    title: "Severance Pay: Are Employers Required to Pay It?",
    description: "Federal law does not require severance pay. Whether you're entitled to it depends on your contract, your employer's written policy, and the WARN Act. Here's what to know.",
    date: "2026-06-25",
