    slug: "overtime-rules-by-state",
    title: "Overtime Rules by State: 2026 Reference Guide",
    description: "Most states follow the federal 40-hour rule, but California, Alaska, Nevada and Colorado add daily overtime. Several states set higher salary thresholds for exempt workers.",
